  "prefLabel": "Fis 1110.03 Bear, Turkey, Migratory Waterfowl, and Pheasant",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 1110.03 Bear, Turkey, Migratory Waterfowl, and Pheasant. In addition to the agent fee required by RSA 214-A:4, I:\n\n(a) The fee for a bear license and tag, pursuant to RSA 208:24, II, shall be $15 for residents and $47 for nonresidents.\n\n(b) The fee for an additional bear license and tag shall be $15 for residents and $47 for nonresidents.\n\n(c) The fee for a resident turkey license, pursuant to RSA 214:9, XI, shall be $15.\n\n(d) The fee for a nonresident turkey license, pursuant to RSA 214:9, XI-a, shall be $30.\n\n(e) The fee for a migratory waterfowl license, pursuant to RSA 214:9, XII, shall be $10.\n\n(f) The fee for a pheasant license, pursuant to RSA 214:9, X, shall be $30.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Fis 1100) #8183, eff 9-28-04 (from Fis 1102.07 and 1102.08); amd by #9800-A, paras (a), (b), (c), and (f); amd by #9800-B, eff 1-1-11, paras (d) & (e); ss by #12785, eff 5-22-19; ss by #13644, eff 6-1-23; ss by #13874, eff 2-23-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/fis1100.html"
